_{E,T}&\\sim\\frac\\Delta{\\sqrt{2\\log T}}\\longrightarrow0,\n \\label{eq:sigmaasymptotic}\\\\\n v_{E,T}&\\sim\\frac{\\Delta^2T}{2E^2\\log T}\\longrightarrow\\infty,\n \\label{eq:privacydivergence}\\\\\n V_E(T,S)&\\sim v_{E,T}\\qquad\\text{for each fixed }S\\geq0.\n \\label{eq:total-equivalent}\n\\end{align}\n\\end{theorem}"},{"assessmentStatus":"reported","assessments":[{"author":{"id":"OpenAI Codex, implementation agent","kind":"model"},"authority":"attributed-component-assessment","basis":"Inspected exact r05 source signatures and current mathematical derivation; model-attributed correspondence, not independent certification.","claimId":"thm:smallbatch","claimRevision":"sha256:bf37f1efcf293770fba61f4b50f99a8a32d5f0425b9db71bb59e3c760afb9ec0","componentId":"leading","currency":"current","differences":["Formal horizons are E+extra and logarithm is log(T/E); log(T/E)/log T -> 1 for fixed E. Total equivalent divides by the leading term, then combine with privacy equivalent."],"evidenceRefs":["sha256:58530882c214bcaf0a339523ac0af6e20a22802e0e20ce987cf30f96389e8e55#/components/11"],"id":"component-assessment-11","kind":"reported-implication-without-checked-adapter","references":{"":{"input":"assessments","pointer":"/assessments/11","revision":"sha256:c465e7b5f5f8504758266a657ce694b13037f5a130c162da3cf5934608c86404"}},"reviewerAuthentication":"not-assessed","scope":"Raw/variance equivalents and limits; fixed-energy total equivalent","targetRevisions":[{"revision":"sha256:6536560e4507b9400296884915c61a09bfa49ddec64fa6716e0db4275f8db5c9","targetId":"raw-ratio"},{"revision":"sha256:c8c24b20876b57947bae2d25df103327efbb81e8cba6508de10d04d1327f49a6","targetId":"raw-zero"},{"revision":"sha256:0594358f856a7cc9cbc2395cad7e0c2bd18cbcb2a0a5cc43c76d3269c4dd3f99","targetId":"variance-ratio"},{"revision":"sha256:8d8bb01f3524ca497beb831a50486e0b72c61e454abe5b63b6f348248eec3c1b","targetId":"variance-infinity"},{"revision":"sha256:50481877c636bf8ff7b6fb6960b029b74ed494ce550bb233dceca5c